{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 596.0, 842.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [30.236523437499997, 65.74013671875, 523.8572265625, 401.30673828125], "text": "", "type": "Figure"}, {"bbox": [48.890625, 420.5888671875, 262.1874084472656, 436.719970703125], "text": "Thesis Advisory Committee (TAC)", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [48.30859375, 438.267578125, 553.0, 459.0250549316406], "text": "The Thesis Advisory Committee must be formed within 2 months after the student has confirmed his/her supervisor. For students enrolled in the Aug intake, it is 01 Mar (of the following year); For students in the Jan intake, it is 01 Aug of the same year.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [48.890625, 477.3900146484375, 155.74462890625, 490.3500061035156], "text": "Composition of TAC", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [61.560001373291016, 506.925048828125, 537.0970458984375, 527.072265625], "text": "1. The TAC should consist of the supervisor, co-supervisor (if any) and at least two other non-supervisory members (capped at 5 persons in the TAC).", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [84.9765625, 537.3505859375, 346.055908203125, 547.0050659179688], "text": "The possible compositions of a TAC are listed in the table below.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [81.27484375, 557.66876953125, 518.21734375, 665.86248046875], "text": "Main Supervisor Co \u2013 supervisor (1) Co \u2013 supervisor (2) Non supervisory member (1) Non-supervisory member 2 Total no. in the TAC 1 - - 1 1 3 1 1 - 1 1 4 1 1 1 1 1 5", "type": "Table"}, {"bbox": [83.59463045595875, 558.723143974705, 153.72151593494175, 602.2951678504842], "text": "Main Supervisor", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [153.56153064487563, 558.723143974705, 213.23604383953872, 602.2951678504842], "text": "Co \u2013 supervisor (1)", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [212.9694016894285, 558.723143974705, 272.32394430395937, 602.2951678504842], "text": "Co \u2013 supervisor (2)", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [272.4039369489924, 558.723143974705, 361.14244450566747, 602.2951678504842], "text": "Non supervisory member (1)", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [361.22243715070056, 558.723143974705, 439.1352734129014, 602.2951678504842], "text": "Non-supervisory member 2", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [439.02861655285733, 558.723143974705, 515.2616072693639, 602.2951678504842], "text": "Total no. in the TAC", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [83.62129467096977, 601.8668282328306, 153.72151593494175, 623.3365278376837], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [153.56153064487563, 601.8668282328306, 213.23604383953872, 623.3365278376837], "text": "-", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [212.9694016894285, 601.8668282328306, 272.32394430395937, 623.3365278376837], "text": "-", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [272.4039369489924, 601.8668282328306, 361.14244450566747, 623.3365278376837], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [361.22243715070056, 601.8668282328306, 439.1352734129014, 623.3365278376837], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [439.02861655285733, 601.8668282328306, 515.3682641294081, 623.3365278376837], "text": "3", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [83.72795153101386, 623.0597545462766, 153.72151593494175, 644.1077043737478], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [153.56153064487563, 623.0597545462766, 213.23604383953872, 644.1077043737478], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [212.9694016894285, 623.0597545462766, 272.32394430395937, 644.1077043737478], "text": "-", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [272.4039369489924, 623.0597545462766, 361.14244450566747, 644.1077043737478], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [361.22243715070056, 623.0597545462766, 439.1352734129014, 644.1077043737478], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [439.02861655285733, 623.0597545462766, 515.2616072693639, 644.1077043737478], "text": "4", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [83.83460839105794, 643.8770599642419, 153.72151593494175, 665.0040878749721], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [153.56153064487563, 643.8770599642419, 213.23604383953872, 664.9513691527993], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [212.9694016894285, 643.8770599642419, 272.32394430395937, 664.9513691527993], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [272.4039369489924, 643.8770599642419, 361.14244450566747, 664.9777285138857], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [361.22243715070056, 643.8770599642419, 439.1352734129014, 664.9513691527993], "text": "1", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [439.02861655285733, 643.8770599642419, 515.3682641294081, 664.9513691527993], "text": "5", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [66.642578125, 680.013671875, 554.7921752929688, 730.8750686645508], "text": "", "type": "ListGroup"}, {"bbox": [66.93359375, 680.013671875, 511.170166015625, 689.880859375], "text": "2. At least one member of the TAC should be from a different Faculty/School to that of the student/supervisor.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [66.93359375, 689.4697265625, 452.447021484375, 699.7950744628906], "text": "3. Both the supervisor and student are jointly responsible for the timely formation of the TAC.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [66.93359375, 699.748046875, 554.7921752929688, 720.7950668334961], "text": "4. No-one directly involved in supervising the student shall act as the Chair of the TAC. ISEP would review and appoint the nominee. The Chair should be appointed before the first formal meeting with the student.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [66.642578125, 721.5380859375, 552.6830444335938, 730.8750686645508], "text": "5. The Chair of the TAC should be nominated by the supervisor and the Chairperson has to be an ISEP supervisor.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [541.580078125, 781.5634765625, 553.0172729492188, 793.0159950256348], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}], "doc_id": "ISEP_student_handbook_2020.pdf", "page_index": 12, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/ISEP_student_handbook_2020.pdf", "source": "marker"}